/T (Altoro contracted Taj Trust Foundation to do a structured Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing \(VAPT\) engagement against their chosen digital applications and infrastructure. This engagement's goals are to find weaknesses in security, assess how well the defenses in place are working, and recreate actual attack methods that a skilled threat actor may use to obtain unauthorized access or interfere with operations.)
/E (Altoro contracted Taj Trust Foundation to do a structured Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing \(VAPT\) engagement against their chosen digital applications and infrastructure. This engagement's goals are to find weaknesses in security, assess how well the defenses in place are working, and recreate actual attack methods that a skilled threat actor may use to obtain unauthorized access or interfere with operations.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
