473 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 343 0 R
/T (The primary objective of this Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing \(VAPT\) engagement was to evaluate the security posture of the Altoro Mutual Bank web application. The assessment aimed to identify, validate, and prioritize vulnerabilities that could be exploited by an attacker to compromise confidentiality, integrity, or availability. Specifically, this report details findings related to OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities, authentication flaws, session management issues, and server-side misconfigurations.)
/E (The primary objective of this Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing \(VAPT\) engagement was to evaluate the security posture of the Altoro Mutual Bank web application. The assessment aimed to identify, validate, and prioritize vulnerabilities that could be exploited by an attacker to compromise confidentiality, integrity, or availability. Specifically, this report details findings related to OWASP Top 10 vulnerabilities, authentication flaws, session management issues, and server-side misconfigurations.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [14]
>>
