650 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 350 0 R
/E (During the security assessment, a DOM-based Cross-Site Scripting \(XSS\) vulnerability was identified. The application was found to insecurely process user-controlled input and sink it directly into the Document Object Model \(DOM\) environment without adequate sanitization, validation, or context-aware encoding. Specifically, the application was susceptible to a polyglot XSS payload executed via the URL/input parameter. The following payload was successfully executed #jaVasCript:/*-/*`/*\\`/*'/*"/**/\(/* */oNcliCk=alert\(5397\))
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [15]
>>
endobj
651 0 obj
<<
