/P 350 0 R
/E (g/<sVg/oNloAd=alert\(5397\)//>\\x3e)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [17]
>>
endobj
653 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 350 0 R
/E (This complex payload uses mixed casing, comment variations \(/* ... */\), encoding tricks \(\\x3c\), and multiple HTML closing tags \(such as </script>, </textarea>, </style>\) to bypass weak client-side or server-side Web Application Firewall \(WAF\) filters. Once executed, it forces the DOM to dynamically render and execute malicious JavaScript \(in this case, triggering alert\(5397\)\) within the context of the user's browser session.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [18]
>>
endobj
