/Title (Altoro contracted Taj Trust Foundation to do a structured Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing \(VAPT\) engagement against their chosen digital applications and infrastructure. This engagement's goals are to find weaknesses in security, assess how well the defenses in place are working, and recreate actual attack methods that a skilled threat actor may use to obtain unauthorized access or interfere with operations.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3165 0 R
/Next 3427 0 R
>>
endobj
3427 0 obj
<<
/Title (VAPT involves active analysis, scanning, and controlled exploitation of vulnerabilities found within the specified scope, in contrast to passive reconnaissance. The results represent a thorough assessment of Altoro's current level of security, offering practical technical knowledge and repair suggestions to actively enhance defenses prior to a violent assault.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 3165 0 R
/Prev 3426 0 R
>>
